Subject: [PATCH v1 0/4] usb: typec: add Silicon Mitus SM5714 CC and MUIC drivers
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add bindings and drivers for the Type-C CC detection block and the MUIC
data-role switch of the Silicon Mitus SM5714 PMIC (Samsung Galaxy A52 4G,
a52q, SM7125). The fuel-gauge and charger blocks of the same chip are
sent separately to the power-supply tree.

The CC driver debounces the sink (host-mode) attach so the free-running
DRP toggle on an unplugged port does not register and unregister the xHCI
host a few times a second.

Based on v7.3-rc5. Not independently tested on hardware by the
submitter tooling; on-device verification pending.

